Law texts

The texts in this repository are Laws of Ebonyi State, taken from the copies the Ebonyi State Government publishes at
ebonyistate.gov.ng ("Laws and Financials" (public records)).

- Copyright: the Copyright Act, 2022 (Nigeria), s. 3, says: "The following shall not be eligible for copyright -- ...
  (b) official texts of a legislative or administrative nature as well as any official translations, except their
  compilations". The Laws here are such official texts. The website carries a general "All rights reserved" footer, which
  does not reach texts that are not eligible for copyright; no compilation of the Government's is copied.
- The Government's PDFs are not the authoritative text: the Laws as published in the Ebonyi State Official Gazette are.

Attribution: Source: Ebonyi State Government, https://ebonyistate.gov.ng.

Everything else (the git history's structure, the tools and the documentation): CC0 1.0 Universal,
